under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

This project vendors elastic/start-local (https://github.com/elastic/start-local,
version 0.14.0) under elastic-start-local/, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. Upstream provenance comments are retained in the vendored scripts.

The local development stack scripts under elastic-start-local/ pull official
Elastic container images (Elasticsearch, Kibana, APM Server, Elastic Agent)
from docker.elastic.co. Those images are distributed under the Elastic
License 2.0, not Apache 2.0, and their use is subject to Elastic's terms.
The stack identifies itself to Elastic via config/telemetry.yml.
